@k.words.upper.noun.1 k.words.sense word=upper pos=noun n=1 gloss="the higher of two berths" synonym="upper berth" is_a=berth core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.words.upper.noun.2 k.words.sense word=upper pos=noun n=2 gloss="piece of leather or synthetic material that forms the part of a shoe or boot above the sole that encases the foot" is_a="piece of leather" part_of=shoe part_of=boot core.source="wordnet 3.1"
